if we want to access external means we can create node port

for this no need to write seperate manifest file

we need to chnage type in above file like below


vim service.yml

---
apiVersion: v1------------> to view which version we need to give here the command was ----->kubectl api-resources | grep -i "services"
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: secondservice
spec:
  type: NodePort
  selector:
    app: swiggy
  ports:
    - port: 80
      targetPort: 80


